#showas:入侵的獾
Commander, we have a problem. We were wondering why the AI in this area seemed to be so heavily focused on defense.
It turns out there is a massive alliance of other factions preparing to invade this region of the galaxy!
Can you face the combined might of the Elderlings, Nanocaust, Scourge, Marauders, Dark Zenith and more?

2 difficulty 5 AIs rule a Clusters Galaxy (Hidden Galaxy mode).

This also includes the use of Distributed Resource Generation Mode.